  "dimensions": [
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_aa1fec3d",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: help refugees; hasOverallIntent: Propaganda; overall-intent-description: The image features a close-up of an elderly man with a shocked or exaggerated facial expression, overlaid with the text 'help refugees.' The visual juxtaposition of the man's intense, almost comical reaction with the humanitarian plea is designed to evoke an emotional response — likely shock, urgency, or moral outrage — to compel viewers to take action. The intent is propagandistic: to frame the issue of refugee aid as an immediate, emotionally compelling crisis requiring public intervention. The meme leverages the power of visual reaction to amplify the message, aiming to influence opinions or actions toward supporting refugees. There is no evidence of toxicity (abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous) in this specific image, as it does not target any individual or group based on protected characteristics. The intent is purely to mobilize support for a humanitarian cause through emotional manipulation and visual contrast.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_085c42b9"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_0a05d5e8",
