      "instance_name": "elderly_man",
      "label": "person",
      "description": "An elderly man with white hair, wearing a dark suit and a red patterned tie, is shown in a close-up shot. His facial expression is exaggerated, with wide eyes and a slightly open mouth, conveying shock or alarm. This expression is central to the meme's visual impact and is juxtaposed with the text 'help refugees' to evoke an emotional response.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_085c42b9"
